questions.text:
List-I shows four planar structures made of uniform solid rods each of mass $m$ and length $l$. In the List-II the possible moment of inertia of these structures about an axis $O C O^{\prime}$, which lies in the plane of the structures, are given.
Choose the option that describes the correct match between the entries in List-I to those in List-II.

List-I
(P) \includegraphics{https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/29f8b727-48a8-4bba-8b95-542e9562d45f-24.jpg?height=311&width=306&top_left_y=790&top_left_x=580}
(Q) \includegraphics{https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/29f8b727-48a8-4bba-8b95-542e9562d45f-24.jpg?height=237&width=409&top_left_y=1121&top_left_x=493}
(R) \includegraphics{https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/29f8b727-48a8-4bba-8b95-542e9562d45f-24.jpg?height=386&width=288&top_left_y=1402&top_left_x=557}
(S) \includegraphics{https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/29f8b727-48a8-4bba-8b95-542e9562d45f-24.jpg?height=290&width=206&top_left_y=1861&top_left_x=601}

List-II
(1) $\frac{5}{4} m l^{2}$
(2) $\frac{1}{6} m l^{2}$
(3) $\frac{1}{12} m l^{2}$
(4) $\frac{2}{3} m l^{2}$
(5) $\frac{1}{3} m l^{2}$

